{"lines":[{"t":"Test 1","w":0.057613169352213528,"h":0.013096803770750509,"y":0.10174418590380141,"c":1,"x":0.12962962921278212},{"x":0.12962962796495228,"t":"READING PASSAGE 3","y":0.14534883707300938,"w":0.28806584676106772,"c":1,"h":0.014545155919482688},{"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 27-40, which are based on Reading","x":0.12953921948341179,"y":0.17680471209465665,"h":0.023154688948596402,"c":1,"w":0.77594258626302093},{"y":0.19758539480407467,"c":1,"h":0.016195524146054074,"w":0.15843621571858724,"t":"Passage 3 below.","x":0.12962962864176836},{"x":0.39896707980647372,"c":1,"t":"What is exploration?","h":0.023386621643713523,"y":0.23060939309590456,"w":0.24743639628092451},{"h":0.01751034054795475,"x":0.12962962590727101,"y":0.26737338052423487,"t":"We are all explorers. Our desire to discover, and then share that new-found knowledge, is part","w":0.74897120157877606,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.017667844522968212,"w":0.76543207804361979,"y":0.28474676066910598,"t":"of what makes us human - indeed, this has played an important part in our success as a species.","x":0.12962963994976273},{"w":0.74897120157877595,"y":0.30232558123219799,"x":0.12962962556621591,"t":"Long before the first caveman slumped down beside the fire and grunted news that there were","h":0.017462404653236896,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"plenty of wildebeest over yonder, our ancestors had learnt the value of sending out scouts to","w":0.73476862589518233,"x":0.12951841628977301,"y":0.31738121276892084,"h":0.019133867728836629},{"x":0.12957242659431434,"y":0.33543787294701288,"t":"investigate the unknown. This questing nature of ours undoubtedly helped our species spread","h":0.016003353154841804,"c":1,"w":0.74089350382486985},{"t":"around the globe, just as it nowadays no doubt helps the last nomadic Penan maintain their","h":0.01935857766087401,"c":1,"y":0.34971017843977614,"x":0.13155777281224326,"w":0.72249542236328124},{"w":0.74304545084635409,"y":0.36596493099929028,"c":1,"h":0.022506606031222343,"t":"existence in the depleted forests of Borneo, and a visitor negotiate the subways of New York.","x":0.12949878292097347},{"t":"Over the years, we've come to think of explorers as a peculiar breed - different from the rest of","x":0.12954582578315854,"h":0.019967783466244726,"w":0.76358103434244784,"y":0.40029227587722804,"c":1},{"h":0.020700969179330841,"c":1,"t":"us, different from those of us who are merely well travelled', even; and perhaps there is a type of","x":0.12954529797589051,"y":0.41710719208481317,"w":0.7820843505859375},{"t":"person more suited to seeking out the new, a type of caveman more inclined to risk venturing out.","x":0.12954043143626032,"w":0.77998540242513026,"h":0.018746308640119502,"c":1,"y":0.43440250216863618},{"w":0.78409296671549478,"x":0.12957010826020299,"y":0.45125972891970922,"h":0.01858028056905181,"c":1,"t":"That, however, doesn't take away from the fact that we all have this enquiring instinct, even today;"},{"t":"and that in all sorts of professions - whether artist, marine biologist or astronomer - borders of","x":0.12955933667544201,"h":0.018633632412788037,"y":0.46798839546189419,"c":1,"w":0.76352966308593762},{"y":0.486918604496827,"x":0.1296296278753771,"w":0.31687243143717447,"t":"the unknown are being tested each day.","h":0.016026036337772775,"c":1},{"x":0.13161761899327104,"t":"Thomas Hardy set some of his novels in Egdon Heath, a fictional area of uncultivated land, and","w":0.75942138671875004,"c":1,"h":0.018688462507879255,"y":0.51741313605579575},{"x":0.12956018011664602,"y":0.53439561622252763,"h":0.018500340420169126,"w":0.75939860026041661,"t":"used the landscape to suggest the desires and fears of his characters. He is delving into matters","c":1},{"w":0.7656036885579427,"y":0.5498468529295053,"h":0.019160636883882809,"t":"we all recognise because they are common to humanity. This is surely an act of exploration, and","c":1,"x":0.13160046075782286},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"y":0.56831395333239654,"c":1,"x":0.12962962498127864,"t":"into a world as remote as the author chooses. Explorer and travel writer Peter Fleming talks of","w":0.75514404296875004},{"t":"traveller 'who has for weeks or months seen himself only as a puny and irrelevant alien crawling","w":0.77379175821940094,"c":1,"h":0.018106156159345965,"y":0.60116880499799685,"x":0.12956361259092175},{"t":"laboriously over a country in which he has no roots and no background, suddenly encounters his","y":0.61765936441883695,"w":0.77174942016601578,"h":0.018945941093813312,"x":0.12956110091491374,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.63393437703450517,"t":"other self, a relatively solid figure, with a place in the minds of certain peoplẾ","x":0.13158344387563478,"y":0.63478303400106417,"h":0.020452809418048168},{"y":0.66654132402837674,"w":0.75950230916341144,"h":0.021592214334979931,"t":"In this book about the exploration of the earth's surface, I have confined myself to those whose","x":0.12952170064336391,"c":1},{"y":0.70035400484483856,"w":0.76557607014973972,"x":0.12955321330200709,"h":0.019362794496426083,"c":1,"t":"another problem: the word 'explorerhas become associated with a past era. We think back to a"},{"c":1,"x":0.13151754888659942,"h":0.021579596403771273,"w":0.77808308919270841,"t":"golden age, as if exploration peaked somehow in the 19th century - as if the process of discovery","y":0.71587468282312161},{"x":0.12952071310023919,"y":0.73332842024780098,"c":1,"w":0.76976669311523438,"h":0.020425394370502503,"t":"is now on the decline, though the truth is that we have named only one and a half million of this"},{"h":0.021905445238165067,"w":0.75752314249674479,"t":"planet's species, and there may be more than 10 million - and that's not including bacteria. We","c":1,"x":0.1294651070088228,"y":0.74964997923719168},{"x":0.12957418690161945,"c":1,"y":0.76731165068461471,"w":0.76964533487955722,"h":0.019441483298797135,"t":"have studied only 5 per cent of the species we know. We have scarcely mapped the ocean floors,"},{"t":"and know even less about ourselves; we fully understand the workings of only 10 per cent of our","y":0.78393813652570532,"w":0.77184051513671881,"c":1,"x":0.13157330156585145,"h":0.020129422838190858},{"y":0.80482985573926735,"w":0.061372763315836604,"x":0.13074348788761514,"h":0.013874885190642505,"t":"brains.","c":1},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"24","y":0.92005813935786906,"c":1,"w":0.02674897193908693,"x":0.13168724232263759}],"w":2400,"h":3395}